WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.500
Ryu recovers as the opponent lands after light Tatsu.

2
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:00.650
Ryu extends a standing light punch before the opponent has fully risen.

3
00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:01.200
Ryu recovers from the jab as the opponent gets up.

4
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.100
Ryu blocks the glowing wake-up OD Shoryuken.

5
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:02.280
Ryu holds position as the blocked reversal descends.
